            "review_title": "Review at 2D Sketch Cafe",
            "review_text": "Stay48188869840\nSouth Korea5 contributions\n1\nUnique cafe to capture memories\nAug 2026 • Solo\nI think it's a unique and fun cafe in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. The various kinds of drinks and dessert breads, and the signature drinks were particularly impressive and delicious. And the homemade yogurt was a delicacy in particular. It was the most delicious yogurt I've eaten recently. \nAlso, I think a special point here is that it is a place highly specialized for taking pictures. You can leave beautiful photos and memories with various sketched pictures! \nI think this is a unique cafe in Ho Chi Minh City where you can make memories with friends, a lover, or family rather than going alone. \nI also had a good time here while traveling.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Korean\nShow original\nWritten September 16, 2026",
